      "writtenOn": "2019-09-27T16:55:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"deny\" and \"allow\" are rust specific lint levels:\nhttps://doc.rust-lang.org/rustc/lints/levels.html\n\"warnings\" is a rust lint group:\nhttps://doc.rust-lang.org/rustc/lints/groups.html\nSo \"deny warnings\" is rust equivalent of -Werror\nand \"allow warnings\" is similar to -Wno-* to suppress/ignore all warnings.\n\"allow warnings\" would be confusing, since we do not need -Wno-*.\nWe want default -Werror, and some projects without -Werror to see and fix all warnings.",
      "parentUuid": "92391e18_312a58df",
      "revId": "de46a27be5bfa7e061b261018be1f504d619ff09",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
